1
00:02:40,440 --> 00:02:44,240
<font color="#ffffff">PREVIOUSLY</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

2
00:02:44,320 --> 00:02:45,280
<font color="#ffffff">Take all of them!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

3
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:49,080
<font color="#ffffff">-What now?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-I don't think we can keep going.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

4
00:02:49,160 --> 00:02:50,240
<font color="#ffffff">We're surrounded.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

5
00:02:53,400 --> 00:02:56,120
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I was the one who sent my men</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>to rescue you.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

6
00:02:56,720 --> 00:02:59,200
<font color="#ffffff">I'm glad you made it back safely.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

7
00:02:59,800 --> 00:03:02,200
<font color="#ffffff">-Do we know each other?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-I'm your girlfriend.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

8
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:05,640
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho Suea is currently arranging</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

9
00:03:05,720 --> 00:03:09,120
<font color="#ffffff">for Chan to turn himself in</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to a higher-up he knows.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

10
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:10,800
<font color="#ffffff">Go find out.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

11
00:03:11,480 --> 00:03:13,800
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod, good news.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

12
00:03:13,880 --> 00:03:16,920
<font color="#ffffff">Commander Chayanon has agreed to help you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

13
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:18,360
<font color="#ffffff">Where are you going?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

14
00:03:18,440 --> 00:03:20,360
<font color="#ffffff">I'm going home.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

15
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:22,480
<font color="#ffffff">I'm turning myself in tomorrow,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

16
00:03:22,560 --> 00:03:23,960
<font color="#ffffff">it'll be over.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

17
00:03:24,040 --> 00:03:26,480
<font color="#ffffff">You can go back to your normal life.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

18
00:03:26,560 --> 00:03:28,240
<font color="#ffffff">You're leaving too?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

19
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,600
<font color="#ffffff">What about Luang Pho Suea?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

20
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:33,800
<font color="#ffffff">Has Chan started to doubt him at all?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

21
00:03:34,400 --> 00:03:38,000
<font color="#ffffff">Even though Chan is starting to feel</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">slightly uneasy around Luang Pho,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

22
00:03:38,640 --> 00:03:40,600
<font color="#ffffff">he still trusts him implicitly.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

23
00:03:41,200 --> 00:03:43,720
<font color="#ffffff">So in the end, we still don't know</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">where the diamond is.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

24
00:03:44,320 --> 00:03:46,440
<font color="#ffffff">If Captain Chansuek gets his memory back,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

25
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,680
<font color="#ffffff">he might know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

26
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:51,920
<font color="#ffffff">How certain are you that your Boonrod</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

27
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:54,640
<font color="#ffffff">isn't just putting on an act for you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and everyone else?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

28
00:03:55,560 --> 00:03:58,240
<font color="#ffffff">What if he hid the diamond away,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

29
00:03:58,320 --> 00:03:59,400
<font color="#ffffff">and once it blew over,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

30
00:03:59,480 --> 00:04:01,560
<font color="#ffffff">he'll sell it and run off with the cash?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

31
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:06,480
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod would never do that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

32
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:07,800
<font color="#ffffff">I know him well, Dad.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

33
00:04:07,880 --> 00:04:09,240
<font color="#ffffff">Noona,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

34
00:04:09,320 --> 00:04:13,040
<font color="#ffffff">are you letting your personal feelings</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">cloud your judgment?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

35
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:15,000
<font color="#ffffff">What, Dad?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

36
00:04:15,080 --> 00:04:16,600
<font color="#ffffff">Why would you say that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

37
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:19,880
<font color="#ffffff">Because you're defending him</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">in a strange way.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

38
00:04:20,519 --> 00:04:22,240
<font color="#ffffff">Tell me the truth, Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

39
00:04:22,320 --> 00:04:23,760
<font color="#ffffff">Do you have feelings for him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

40
00:04:23,840 --> 00:04:25,560
<font color="#ffffff">What are you saying, Dad?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

41
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:28,400
<font color="#ffffff">Why would I fall for him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

42
00:04:29,160 --> 00:04:30,000
<font color="#ffffff">Noona.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

43
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:34,720
<font color="#ffffff">You need to tell me if your feelings</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for your target have changed.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

44
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:38,600
<font color="#ffffff">Then I can't let you work</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">on this case anymore.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

45
00:04:38,680 --> 00:04:40,720
<font color="#ffffff">It's against the rules.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

46
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:42,040
<font color="#ffffff">You understand, right?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

47
00:04:44,480 --> 00:04:46,840
<font color="#ffffff">Jeez, Dad. I know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

48
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:50,480
<font color="#ffffff">If you understand,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">then go home and get some rest.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

49
00:04:52,400 --> 00:04:55,400
<font color="#ffffff">I won't. I'll stay here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

50
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,560
<font color="#ffffff">You've been away for months.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

51
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:59,240
<font color="#ffffff">Don't you want to go home?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

52
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:02,600
<font color="#ffffff">Even if I did, I'd be alone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

53
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:04,880
<font color="#ffffff">I'd rather stay here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

54
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:11,560
<font color="#ffffff">If you won't go home, then I will.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

55
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:14,400
<font color="#ffffff">Sure.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

56
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:16,360
<font color="#ffffff">Bye-bye! Good night!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

57
00:06:07,160 --> 00:06:09,960
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, you've gotten so jumpy lately.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

58
00:06:10,040 --> 00:06:12,440
<font color="#ffffff">How did you get into my room?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

59
00:06:13,040 --> 00:06:14,400
<font color="#ffffff">Why can't I come in?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

60
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,080
<font color="#ffffff">Because it's my private room!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

61
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:21,880
<font color="#ffffff">I feel like since you saw Chansuek,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">you've gotten so uptight!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

62
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:23,680
<font color="#ffffff">Let me go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

63
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:27,160
<font color="#ffffff">You…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

64
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,880
<font color="#ffffff">No!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

65
00:06:32,960 --> 00:06:33,880
<font color="#ffffff">Let me go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

66
00:06:33,960 --> 00:06:35,280
<font color="#ffffff">I won't!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

67
00:06:35,360 --> 00:06:37,120
<font color="#ffffff">I'll scream for help.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

68
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:38,920
<font color="#ffffff">Scream all you want.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

69
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,400
<font color="#ffffff">The boss won't care about a couple's spat.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

70
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:42,720
<font color="#ffffff">Hey, let me go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

71
00:06:43,320 --> 00:06:44,560
<font color="#ffffff">Come here!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

72
00:06:48,840 --> 00:06:50,280
<font color="#ffffff">Let me go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

73
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:54,080
<font color="#ffffff">Let me go!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

74
00:07:06,520 --> 00:07:09,160
<font color="#ffffff">NORTHERN NEWS CENTER</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">MAE KHANING NEWS<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

75
00:07:16,240 --> 00:07:18,240
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong, Captain?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

76
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:21,000
<font color="#ffffff">I can't contact Ya.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

77
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:23,000
<font color="#ffffff">Do you know anything about it?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

78
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:28,480
<font color="#ffffff">I think Ya went to run</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">some errands in Bangkok.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

79
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:30,160
<font color="#ffffff">I don't know when she'll be back.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

80
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:35,680
<font color="#ffffff">I was bringing a drink</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to Ms. Yok's private floor.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

81
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:38,160
<font color="#ffffff">I heard she invited a monk over.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

82
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:41,000
<font color="#ffffff">But in the elevator,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I was with three other guests.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

83
00:07:41,600 --> 00:07:42,520
<font color="#ffffff">Three people?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

84
00:07:43,280 --> 00:07:44,560
<font color="#ffffff">Correct.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

85
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:46,480
<font color="#ffffff">Two women and one man.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

86
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:49,640
<font color="#ffffff">Ms. Ya really did book a room as a guest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

87
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,440
<font color="#ffffff">I'm in a hurry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

88
00:07:51,520 --> 00:07:53,560
<font color="#ffffff">Did you go to Yok's hotel today?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

89
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:54,960
<font color="#ffffff">How do you know?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

90
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:58,760
<font color="#ffffff">I searched the place.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">Your name was on the check-in list.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

91
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:00,520
<font color="#ffffff">So?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

92
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:02,160
<font color="#ffffff">Why did you go there?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

93
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:04,520
<font color="#ffffff">What right do you have to question me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

94
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:08,240
<font color="#ffffff">What exactly are you up to?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

95
00:08:10,520 --> 00:08:12,640
<font color="#ffffff">Did you rescue Luang Pho Suea?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

96
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:27,560
<font color="#ffffff">We're suddenly heading to Bangkok.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

97
00:08:27,640 --> 00:08:29,960
<font color="#ffffff">We should inform Deputy Papon.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

98
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:31,360
<font color="#ffffff">We can tell him later.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

99
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,919
<font color="#ffffff">He didn't order us to return.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

100
00:08:35,840 --> 00:08:37,440
<font color="#ffffff">Why should we stay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

101
00:08:37,520 --> 00:08:39,880
<font color="#ffffff">All the suspects have fled to Bangkok.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

102
00:08:40,799 --> 00:08:41,840
<font color="#ffffff">How did you know?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

103
00:08:45,320 --> 00:08:47,000
<font color="#ffffff">So you know about that too?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

104
00:08:50,960 --> 00:08:52,320
<font color="#ffffff">No, I don't.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

105
00:09:13,760 --> 00:09:17,880
<font color="#ffffff"><i>I think it's because</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Luang Pho Suea saved his life,</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

106
00:09:18,400 --> 00:09:20,240
<font color="#ffffff"><i>so Chan feels like he owes him.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

107
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:37,160
<font color="#ffffff">Don't make any mistakes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

108
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:01,880
<font color="#ffffff">The police are here!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

109
00:10:47,160 --> 00:10:48,120
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

110
00:10:56,160 --> 00:10:57,720
<font color="#ffffff">Take this!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

111
00:11:46,320 --> 00:11:47,480
<font color="#ffffff">Hey!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

112
00:11:48,120 --> 00:11:49,120
<font color="#ffffff">Drop your gun!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

113
00:11:51,480 --> 00:11:52,480
<font color="#ffffff">Now!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

114
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:58,800
<font color="#ffffff">Since you're still a rookie officer,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

115
00:11:59,400 --> 00:12:01,720
<font color="#ffffff">I'll be merciful and spare your life.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

116
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:05,360
<font color="#ffffff">But I'll still shoot you enough</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to paralyze half of your body!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

117
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:25,680
<font color="#ffffff">How are you, Chansuek?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

118
00:12:34,360 --> 00:12:35,880
<font color="#ffffff">If you hadn't helped me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

119
00:12:36,800 --> 00:12:38,480
<font color="#ffffff">I wouldn't be standing here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

120
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:47,760
<font color="#ffffff">I love all my subordinates</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

121
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:48,800
<font color="#ffffff">like they're my own children.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

122
00:12:48,880 --> 00:12:51,040
<font color="#ffffff">And I love my country</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

123
00:12:51,120 --> 00:12:52,720
<font color="#ffffff">like my own parent.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

124
00:12:53,680 --> 00:12:56,320
<font color="#ffffff">You should always</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">give your all for the job,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

125
00:12:56,400 --> 00:12:58,200
<font color="#ffffff">for the sake of our country.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

126
00:13:02,280 --> 00:13:03,440
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

127
00:13:04,080 --> 00:13:07,400
<font color="#ffffff">Whenever you need my help,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">just say the word.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

128
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:10,840
<font color="#ffffff">I'll put my life on the line for you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

129
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:16,760
<font color="#ffffff">I'll take my leave.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

130
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:41,280
<font color="#ffffff">Paul.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

131
00:13:42,040 --> 00:13:44,800
<font color="#ffffff">I already got rid of them,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">so nothing will trace back to us.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

132
00:13:45,360 --> 00:13:48,320
<font color="#ffffff">Now you can clean up the rest.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

133
00:13:48,400 --> 00:13:50,880
<font color="#ffffff">Nothing should lead back to me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

134
00:14:01,600 --> 00:14:04,280
<font color="#ffffff">You're my superior, aren't you?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">You should know me better than anyone.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

135
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:05,600
<font color="#ffffff">If you didn't trust me,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

136
00:14:05,680 --> 00:14:08,200
<font color="#ffffff">you wouldn't have sent me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">on a mission this important.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

137
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:10,720
<font color="#ffffff">But that was in the past.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

138
00:14:10,800 --> 00:14:13,720
<font color="#ffffff">Now, you're with Luang Pho Suea.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

139
00:14:13,800 --> 00:14:15,640
<font color="#ffffff">What does Luang Pho Suea</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">have to do with this?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

140
00:14:15,720 --> 00:14:18,440
<font color="#ffffff">-Do you remember Sergeant Padej?</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Sergeant Padej?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

141
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:21,560
<font color="#ffffff">He's the man you put behind bars</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">six years ago.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

142
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:23,080
<font color="#ffffff">So what?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

143
00:14:23,160 --> 00:14:26,560
<font color="#ffffff">I'll believe that you've lost</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">your memory, Captain.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

144
00:14:26,640 --> 00:14:29,880
<font color="#ffffff">You might just be making this up</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to make me suspicious of him.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

145
00:14:29,960 --> 00:14:34,360
<font color="#ffffff">You said it yourself,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">the diamond isn't with you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

146
00:14:34,440 --> 00:14:36,400
<font color="#ffffff">So why would I play games like that?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

147
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:38,880
<font color="#ffffff">Before you lost contact,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

148
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:42,720
<font color="#ffffff">you sent us a message</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">saying you had the diamond.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

149
00:14:42,800 --> 00:14:46,440
<font color="#ffffff">If you really don't have it now,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

150
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:50,400
<font color="#ffffff">then it must be with the person</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">who found you first, right?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

151
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:55,400
<font color="#ffffff">If you want us to trust you again</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and prove you didn't betray us,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

152
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:57,760
<font color="#ffffff">then just finish the mission.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

153
00:14:57,840 --> 00:14:59,320
<font color="#ffffff">Prove your innocence…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

154
00:14:59,400 --> 00:15:01,920
<font color="#ffffff">by bringing that diamond back to me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

155
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:07,440
<font color="#ffffff">Chansuek.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

156
00:15:08,560 --> 00:15:11,240
<font color="#ffffff">You used to be nothing but my lapdog.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

157
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:18,400
<font color="#ffffff">So I'll make you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">my loyal lapdog once again.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

158
00:15:27,840 --> 00:15:29,240
<font color="#ffffff">Lieutenant Ae?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

159
00:15:33,040 --> 00:15:34,160
<font color="#ffffff">What did you say?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

160
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:07,400
<font color="#ffffff">No matter what anyone tells you</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

161
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:09,200
<font color="#ffffff">about what kind of person you are,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

162
00:16:09,920 --> 00:16:11,640
<font color="#ffffff">it is never as important as</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

163
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:14,520
<font color="#ffffff">how you see yourself.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

164
00:16:15,120 --> 00:16:18,440
<font color="#ffffff">Who you truly are inside.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

165
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:27,520
<font color="#ffffff"><i>And what kind of person</i></font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff"><i>are you really, Luang Pho?</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font></font>

166
00:17:01,880 --> 00:17:04,000
<font color="#ffffff"><i>Captain Kan, come see me in my room.</i></font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

167
00:17:05,079 --> 00:17:06,319
<font color="#ffffff">Understood.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

168
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:16,480
<font color="#ffffff">Why did you come back?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

169
