<font color="#ffffff">Why didn't you tell me first?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

170
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:22,560
<font color="#ffffff">I believe Captain Chansuek</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">may have already come to Bangkok.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

171
00:17:23,200 --> 00:17:24,599
<font color="#ffffff">How did you know?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

172
00:17:24,680 --> 00:17:28,640
<font color="#ffffff">I found out someone's</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">been helping Chansuek's group,<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

173
00:17:29,320 --> 00:17:30,800
<font color="#ffffff">so I followed him back here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

174
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:35,640
<font color="#ffffff">You can go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

175
00:17:46,760 --> 00:17:48,960
<font color="#ffffff">That guy has sharp instincts.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

176
00:17:53,480 --> 00:17:56,680
<font color="#ffffff">I already called them about you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

177
00:17:57,920 --> 00:18:01,160
<font color="#ffffff">You can head straight</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to the meeting place.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

178
00:18:01,240 --> 00:18:04,000
<font color="#ffffff">I think they're probably</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">already waiting for you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

179
00:18:05,280 --> 00:18:09,560
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you, Luang Pho,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">for saving me so many times.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

180
00:18:10,200 --> 00:18:14,880
<font color="#ffffff">By turning myself in today,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I truly hope I can finally clear my name.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

181
00:18:20,600 --> 00:18:22,560
<font color="#ffffff">But remember, Boonrod.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

182
00:18:24,600 --> 00:18:27,280
<font color="#ffffff">Speak nothing but the truth.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

183
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:31,800
<font color="#ffffff">Because the truth will always protect you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

184
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:33,800
<font color="#ffffff">I will.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

185
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:41,040
<font color="#ffffff">Let me know how it goes, okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

186
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:45,680
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry. We'll see Boonrod off</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to the police ourselves.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

187
00:18:48,680 --> 00:18:53,200
<font color="#ffffff">Once he turns himself in,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I'll get the news out to everyone.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

188
00:18:53,280 --> 00:18:56,040
<font color="#ffffff">I think that'll help</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">protect Boonrod a bit more.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

189
00:19:00,200 --> 00:19:02,960
<font color="#ffffff">I hope you'll be safe</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

190
00:19:04,040 --> 00:19:07,360
<font color="#ffffff">and finally be free</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">of all this misfortune.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

191
00:19:07,960 --> 00:19:10,240
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you. I'll take my leave now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

192
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:14,400
<font color="#ffffff">I thought I might've been too late.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

193
00:19:17,400 --> 00:19:18,480
<font color="#ffffff">Da?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

194
00:19:19,960 --> 00:19:21,920
<font color="#ffffff">I want to see you off too, Chan.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

195
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:24,800
<font color="#ffffff">But I don't think that's…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

196
