<font color="#ffffff">how could you call that love?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

198
00:19:39,480 --> 00:19:41,440
<font color="#ffffff">Let me go with you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

199
00:19:42,920 --> 00:19:45,360
