200
00:19:46,280 --> 00:19:48,840
<font color="#ffffff">But I think…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

201
00:19:49,680 --> 00:19:52,480
<font color="#ffffff">I think you should go with Darat.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

202
00:19:52,560 --> 00:19:55,000
