<font color="#ffffff">Then let's do that.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

205
00:20:02,680 --> 00:20:04,560
<font color="#ffffff">Let's hurry, or we'll be late.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

206
00:20:05,720 --> 00:20:06,760
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

207
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:09,840
<font color="#ffffff">I'll take my leave then.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

208
00:20:30,280 --> 00:20:33,000
<font color="#ffffff">If you're worried, should I go too?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

209
00:20:57,760 --> 00:20:58,720
<font color="#ffffff">This is the place.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

210
00:21:00,800 --> 00:21:02,520
<font color="#ffffff">Are you Mr. Boonrod?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

211
00:21:02,600 --> 00:21:04,000
<font color="#ffffff">Yes.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

212
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:06,120
