213
00:21:11,320 --> 00:21:12,160
<font color="#ffffff">Wait.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

214
00:21:14,120 --> 00:21:16,480
<font color="#ffffff">The Commander wants to talk</font><font color="#ffffff">
