00:21:33,720 --> 00:21:34,920
<font color="#ffffff">He's here, Commander.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

216
00:21:38,800 --> 00:21:39,680
<font color="#ffffff">Have a seat.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

217
00:21:44,440 --> 00:21:46,000
<font color="#ffffff">-Good morning.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Good morning.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

218
00:21:51,040 --> 00:21:53,040
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod, you're Suea's disciple?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

219
00:21:54,080 --> 00:21:56,000
<font color="#ffffff">No, he's Luang Pho Suea now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

220
00:21:57,840 --> 00:22:00,240
<font color="#ffffff">Man, I still haven't gotten used to it.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

221
00:22:08,200 --> 00:22:11,280
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho and I are very close friends.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

222
00:22:11,360 --> 00:22:15,480
<font color="#ffffff">He asked me to look after you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

223
00:22:16,040 --> 00:22:18,080
<font color="#ffffff">If you need any help, just let me know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

224
00:22:20,240 --> 00:22:21,200
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

225
00:22:51,560 --> 00:22:54,600
<font color="#ffffff">What are they talking about for so long?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

226
00:22:55,200 --> 00:22:57,440
