231
00:23:12,560 --> 00:23:16,720
<font color="#ffffff">It's going to be tough</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to find anyone who'll believe it.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

232
00:23:17,320 --> 00:23:19,560
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, I know.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

233
00:23:20,520 --> 00:23:22,480
<font color="#ffffff">I'm not sure how much I can help,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

234
00:23:23,280 --> 00:23:26,480
<font color="#ffffff">but for Luang Pho Suea's sake,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I'll do everything I can<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

235
00:23:27,080 --> 00:23:29,840
<font color="#ffffff">to get you treated fairly</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">by the justice system.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

236
00:23:30,440 --> 00:23:31,800
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you so much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

237
00:23:31,880 --> 00:23:33,520
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you very much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

238
00:23:34,160 --> 00:23:35,840
<font color="#ffffff">That is all I ask for.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

239
00:23:37,080 --> 00:23:39,400
<font color="#ffffff">Just a fair trial.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

240
00:23:40,360 --> 00:23:43,000
<font color="#ffffff">If I really did something wrong,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

241
00:23:43,600 --> 00:23:46,720
<font color="#ffffff">I'll take the punishment.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

242
00:23:48,840 --> 00:23:49,680
<font color="#ffffff">Wait a moment.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

243
00:23:56,880 --> 00:23:58,800
<font color="#ffffff">It's me.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

244
00:23:58,880 --> 00:24:00,240
