248
00:24:13,760 --> 00:24:14,840
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

249
00:24:17,920 --> 00:24:19,920
<font color="#ffffff">All right then, go with my men.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

250
00:24:21,200 --> 00:24:23,400
<font color="#ffffff">I've coordinated everything with HQ.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

251
00:24:23,480 --> 00:24:25,880
<font color="#ffffff">Turn yourself in right there.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

252
00:24:34,520 --> 00:24:35,880
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you so much.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

253
00:24:38,800 --> 00:24:40,240
<font color="#ffffff">Of course, sir. Don't worry.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

254
00:25:10,160 --> 00:25:11,800
<font color="#ffffff">How was it, Chan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

255
00:25:16,120 --> 00:25:18,800
<font color="#ffffff">He agreed to help,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">just like Luang Pho said.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

256
00:25:19,600 --> 00:25:22,440
<font color="#ffffff">He's sending me</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to his people at Central Police.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

257
00:25:25,440 --> 00:25:27,440
<font color="#ffffff">Okay, let's go then.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

258
00:25:35,040 --> 00:25:36,120
<font color="#ffffff">We're coming with you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

259
00:25:37,680 --> 00:25:38,960
<font color="#ffffff">For what?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

260
00:25:39,040 --> 00:25:40,800
<font color="#ffffff">This is police business now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

261
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:44,000
<font color="#ffffff">Since I said I'd help,</font><font color="#ffffff">
