262
00:25:44,080 --> 00:25:47,880
<font color="#ffffff">-So I'm coming, no matter what.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">-Yeah, just let us come along.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

263
00:25:48,840 --> 00:25:50,000
<font color="#ffffff">Or is something wrong?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

264
00:25:51,960 --> 00:25:54,360
<font color="#ffffff">You can follow us.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

265
00:25:55,400 --> 00:25:56,280
<font color="#ffffff">Let's go.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

266
00:26:11,200 --> 00:26:12,520
<font color="#ffffff">Didn't you two want to come?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

267
00:26:13,120 --> 00:26:14,040
<font color="#ffffff">Come on.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

268
00:26:17,800 --> 00:26:24,280
<font color="#ffffff">She's so cold to us,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">but so sweet around Boonrod.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

269
00:26:44,240 --> 00:26:47,760
<font color="#ffffff">Don't worry, junior disciple.</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">I'm coming with you.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

270
00:26:47,840 --> 00:26:49,200
<font color="#ffffff">No need to be scared.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

271
00:27:05,040 --> 00:27:06,600
<font color="#ffffff">Please drive faster, Darat.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

272
00:27:06,680 --> 00:27:08,040
<font color="#ffffff">Or we'll lose them.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

273
00:27:08,640 --> 00:27:12,200
<font color="#ffffff">We're already going fast.</font><font color="#ffffff">
