<font color="#ffffff">I really need to use the bathroom now.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

276
00:27:54,560 --> 00:27:55,960
<font color="#ffffff">Could you hurry then?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

277
00:28:37,440 --> 00:28:40,120
<font color="#ffffff">Please slow down.</font><font color="#ffffff">
