00:29:48,760 --> 00:29:50,240
<font color="#ffffff">Where are we going?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

281
00:29:50,320 --> 00:29:52,000
<font color="#ffffff">We're heading out of town.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

282
00:29:53,000 --> 00:29:54,320
<font color="#ffffff">What about Central Police?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

283
00:29:58,160 --> 00:29:59,840
<font color="#ffffff">Where are you taking me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

284
00:30:09,000 --> 00:30:10,800
<font color="#ffffff">See? We lost them.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

285
00:30:11,360 --> 00:30:14,440
<font color="#ffffff">Relax, we already know</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">where they're headed.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

286
00:30:14,520 --> 00:30:16,680
<font color="#ffffff">We'll catch up there.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

287
00:30:37,160 --> 00:30:38,760
<font color="#ffffff">Where are you taking me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

288
00:30:38,840 --> 00:30:40,440
<font color="#ffffff">I said, where are you taking me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

289
00:30:44,080 --> 00:30:45,840
<font color="#ffffff">I said, where are you taking me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

290
00:30:49,240 --> 00:30:51,080
