292
00:32:01,800 --> 00:32:03,200
<font color="#ffffff">You even followed me all the way here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

293
00:32:03,280 --> 00:32:04,560
<font color="#ffffff">Get him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

294
00:32:15,520 --> 00:32:16,680
<font color="#ffffff">Stop!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

295
00:32:29,880 --> 00:32:30,840
<font color="#ffffff">Go cut him off.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

296
00:32:30,920 --> 00:32:31,880
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

297
00:33:21,240 --> 00:33:22,400
<font color="#ffffff">Sergeant, after them!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

298
00:33:45,960 --> 00:33:47,960
<font color="#ffffff">Chansuek, are you okay?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

299
00:33:49,480 --> 00:33:51,000
<font color="#ffffff">I'm okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

300
00:33:52,320 --> 00:33:54,400
<font color="#ffffff">Then let's get out of here.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

301
00:33:55,200 --> 00:33:56,680
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sir.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

302
00:33:56,760 --> 00:33:59,280
<font color="#ffffff">What? Hey, what are you doing?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

303
00:34:07,320 --> 00:34:10,400
<font color="#ffffff">Is this how you repay someone</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">who just saved your life?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

304
00:34:12,159 --> 00:34:13,679
<font color="#ffffff">How were you able to save me?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

305
00:34:14,520 --> 00:34:15,600
<font color="#ffffff">How did you get here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

306
00:34:22,320 --> 00:34:23,880
<font color="#ffffff">What?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

307
00:34:24,560 --> 00:34:27,520
<font color="#ffffff">You two lost track of where Boonrod went?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

308
00:34:28,120 --> 00:34:32,760
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, we went to Central Police,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">but no one there knew anything about it.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

309
00:34:33,360 --> 00:34:37,199
<font color="#ffffff">They said no one</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">ever brought a Boonrod in!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

310
00:34:38,480 --> 00:34:40,040
<font color="#ffffff">How is that possible?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

311
00:34:40,120 --> 00:34:42,480
<font color="#ffffff">What even is going on?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

312
00:34:48,040 --> 00:34:49,520
<font color="#ffffff">Give me that phone.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

313
00:34:50,120 --> 00:34:51,360
<font color="#ffffff">Okay.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

314
00:35:07,440 --> 00:35:09,160
<font color="#ffffff">I can't contact him.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

315
00:35:16,800 --> 00:35:19,680
<font color="#ffffff">Luang Pho, something happened</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">to the junior disciple!<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

316
00:35:19,760 --> 00:35:21,560
<font color="#ffffff">What happened to Boonrod?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

317
00:35:23,920 --> 00:35:25,000
<font color="#ffffff">What's wrong with him?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

318
00:35:44,080 --> 00:35:49,280
<font color="#ffffff">Don't think I'll trust you</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">just because you saved me.<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

319
00:35:51,840 --> 00:35:53,640
<font color="#ffffff">What do you have to say for yourself?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

320
00:35:53,720 --> 00:35:56,160
<font color="#ffffff">How did you know about this,</font><font color="#ffffff">
<font color="#ffffff">and follow me here?<font color="#ffffff"></font></font></font>

321
00:35:59,560 --> 00:36:01,040
<font color="#ffffff">Or is this your plan?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

322
00:36:04,440 --> 00:36:06,360
<font color="#ffffff">You've really changed, Captain.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

323
00:36:07,920 --> 00:36:09,000
<font color="#ffffff">If you won't talk…</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

324
00:36:11,640 --> 00:36:12,720
<font color="#ffffff">I'll shoot you.</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

325
00:36:16,840 --> 00:36:18,240
<font color="#ffffff">Don't do this, Chan!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

326
00:36:19,800 --> 00:36:21,120
<font color="#ffffff">Da?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

327
00:36:21,200 --> 00:36:22,960
<font color="#ffffff">How did you get here?</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

328
00:36:42,920 --> 00:36:45,480
<font color="#ffffff">Listen, you two,</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

329
00:36:46,160 --> 00:36:48,920
<font color="#ffffff">Boonrod is safe now!</font><font color="#ffffff"></font>

330
00:36:53,640 --> 00:36:55,280
